  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Competitiveness of Tourist Destinations</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Competitividad Destinos Tursticos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos principales del Programa son la mejora de la competitividad de Uruguay como destino turstico en el mercado internacional y la optimizacin de la contribucin del turismo al desarrollo socio-econmico del pas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The principal aims of the Program are the improvement of the competitiveness of Uruguay as a tourism destination on the international market, and the optimization of the tourism contribution to the socio-economic development of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
